OL,3,CFuneral to take place for
OL,4,C'trailblazer' Glen Hansard
OL,6,FA funeral is set to take place in
OL,7,FDublin later for "trailblazer" Glen
OL,8,FHansard.
OL,10,FIt comes after thousands of mourners
OL,11,Fattended a public wake for the
OL,12,Fmusician at the Baroque Chapel at the
OL,13,FIrish Museum of Modern Art at the
OL,14,FRoyal Hospital Kilmainham on Monday.
OL,16,FThe frontman of Irish band The Frames
OL,17,Fwas killed at the age of 56 in a
OL,18,Fmotorcycle crash on the outskirts of
OL,19,FDublin last week, hours after taking
OL,20,Fpart in a trad session at The Wren's
OL,21,FNest pub.
