OL,3,CFuneral to take place for
OL,4,C'trailblazer' Glen Hansard
OL,6,FHe had featured in celebrated film The
OL,7,FCommitments, and won an Oscar for best
OL,8,Foriginal song for Falling Slowly in
OL,9,F2008, which he co-wrote with Marketa
OL,10,FIrglova for the movie Once.
OL,12,FHe began an annual Christmas Eve
OL,13,Fcharity busk outside the Gaiety
OL,14,FTheatre 16 years ago, drawing members
OL,15,Fof the public to see famous Irish
OL,16,Fmusicians perform in aid of the
OL,17,Fhomeless in the city.
OL,19,FThe funeral service will take place at
OL,20,FSt Patrick's Cathedral at 1.30pm.
